# Merge strategy for the pipeline's shared append-only files (PRD §15 FR-2).
# Union merge keeps both branches' added lines instead of raising conflict
# markers; /merge-ready's Merge Reconciliation preamble repairs the folded
# result (duplicate counters, duplicate entries) before consolidation.
# /CHANGELOG.md is anchored on purpose: nested copies (templates/, fixtures)
# must not inherit the union rule — these two files and nothing else.
/CHANGELOG.md merge=union
.claude/instincts.md merge=union
